-- spell_dbc additions  (Deepholm, map 646)  --  creature_template_addon.auras
-- referenced these spell ids but they were missing from spell_dbc (this
-- fork's spell_dbc is an incrementally-populated mirror, not a full copy of
-- any client's Spell.dbc). Two sources:
--  * stock WotLK ids: raw-copied straight from the live 3.3.5 client's own
--    Spell.dbc (K:/Dark-Chaos/Server/data/dbc/Spell.dbc) -- no remapping.
--  * Cata-era ids: downported from the real Cataclysm 4.3.4 client
--    (streamed Spell.dbc/SpellEffect.dbc dump, tools/spell_downport.py
--    pipeline) -- SpellVisualID/cooldown/proc/interrupt/category fields
--    default to 0 (unavailable in the streamed client); effects/school/
--    cast-duration-range-radius indices are exact.
-- IDs shared with other maps are duplicated here on purpose so each map's
-- apply run stays self-contained (matches this project's existing pattern).
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

